Subject: [PATCH] feat: video editor skeleton (layout, stores, backend modules,
 deps)

Frontend:
- deps: zustand, immer, pixi.js, zundo; tailwindcss + @tailwindcss/vite (dev)
- Tailwind v4 via vite plugin, src/styles/globals.css imported in main.tsx
- zustand slices (project/playback/timeline/media/ui), editorStore, history middleware
- Pixi-based TimelinePixi + ClipOverlay, PreviewCanvas, TransportControls
- hooks useTauriCommand/useVideoFrame, lib tauriBridge/pixiRenderer
- App.tsx: full-window dark layout (left sidebar, top preview, bottom timeline);
  calls greet command via invoke and logs the result

Backend (src-tauri):
- deps: tokio, anyhow, thiserror, wgpu, cpal, rubato (serde/serde_json kept)
- skeleton modules: commands, decoder, audio, gpu, proxy, project (registered in lib.rs)
- greet(name: String) -> 'Hello, {}! Video editor is ready.' in invoke_handler
